   "zh": "北緯78度的植物化石"
  },
  {
   "type": "subtitle",
   "zh": "Longyearbyen,  Spitsbergen,  Norway"
  },
  {
   "type": "byline",
   "zh": "何康隆"
  },
  {
   "type": "image",
   "src": "images/flow/p_new_18xaeJ/img1.jpg",
   "caption_zh": "發現你",
   "caption_en": ""
  },
  {
   "type": "stanza",
   "zh": [
    "在北極圈內",
    "緯度78度的山谷盡頭",
    "冰河犁過的碎石斜坡"
   ],
   "en": [
    "Within the Arctic Circle",
    "At the end of a valley at 78 degrees latitude",
    "The scree slope ploughed by the glacier"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "stanza",
   "zh": [
    "你靜臥在濕涼的岩面",
    "淡黃  暗紅  深綠",
    "枝葉輪廓微露",
    "像濃霧漸散的樹林",
    "迷離  神秘",
    "經緯脈絡",
    "面面朝上",
    "像攤開的掌紋, 蘊藏",
    "待解的謎題"
   ],
   "en": [
    "You lie quietly on the cool, damp rock",
    "Pale yellow, deep red, dark green",
    "Branches and leaves faintly reveal their outline",
    "Like a forest as thick fog gradually clears",
    "Blurred, mysterious",
    "The warp and weft of veins",
    "Every face turned upward",
    "Like an open palm's lines, holding within",
    "A riddle still unsolved"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "stanza",
   "zh": [
    "踱步寒涼山谷",
    "於石塊疊疊的探尋中",
    "我隱隱了悟 :",
    "在每個緯度之下",
    "暗藏著",
    "另一個的緯度的遺跡",
    "在冰原雪地之下",
    "潛伏著",
    "熱帶的海灣",
    "失落的森林",
    "似乎",
    "每一塊碎岩",
    "都殷殷見証",
    "滄海可以轉成桑田",
    "白雲可以化成蒼狗"
   ],
   "en": [
    "Pacing through the cold, chill valley",
    "Amid the searching through stacked stones",
    "I faintly come to understand:",
    "Beneath every latitude",
    "Secretly hidden within",
    "Ruins of another latitude",
    "Beneath the icefields and snow",
    "Lying hidden",
    "A tropical bay",
    "The lost forest",
    "It seems",
    "Every broken rock",
    "All bear earnest witness",
    "The vast sea can turn into mulberry fields",
    "White clouds can turn into gray dogs"
   ]
  },
  {
   "type": "stanza",
   "zh": [
    "有若積雪消溶",
    "晨光下",
    "你石化的容顏逐漸明晰",
    "泛散著",
    "原始的光澤",
    "隱隱啟示",
    "遠古窩藏於現今",
    "明日是永恆的倒影"
   ],
   "en": [
    "Like accumulated snow melting away",
    "Beneath the morning light",
    "Your fossilized face grows gradually clear",
    "Diffusing outward",
    "A primal luster",
    "Faintly revealing",
    "Antiquity lies hidden within the present",
    "Tomorrow is an eternal reflection"
   ]
  }
 ],
